SF0134 Industrial siting-wildlife mitigation.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Hicks and Landen and Representative(s)
Byron
AN ACT relating to industrial development and siting; requiring the payment of
wildlife mitigation impact costs for industrial siting projects as specified;
providing definitions; making conforming amendments; specifying applicability;
requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
